Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 08:35:57 -0700
Subject: [M156] [canvas2d] Pass precomputed image orientation into
 DrawImageInternal

Original change's description:
> [canvas2d] Pass precomputed image orientation into DrawImageInternal
>
> Canvas2DRecorderContext::drawImage() already queries
> RespectImageOrientationInternal() before invoking Draw(), but
> DrawImageInternal() queries it a second time while holding a raw
> cc::PaintCanvas* pointer.
>
> Because RespectImageOrientationInternal() calls EnsureComputedStyle(),
> a synchronous style recalculation inside DrawImageInternal() can run
> scripts and resize the canvas, invalidating the active PaintCanvas
> pointer mid-draw. Pass the already-resolved RespectImageOrientationEnum
> down to DrawImageInternal() instead of recomputing it.
>
> Bug: 570167920
> Change-Id: I1e3bcc63d969311d394a0ff4e72a0484c182a084
